## Status Tracking

Throughout the workflow, the following status markers are used:

- **[to-do]**: Step has not been started
- **[in-progress]**: Step is currently being worked on
- **[done]**: Step has been completed

The AI should update these status markers in both this reference file and the context file as each step is started and completed.

## Context Management

The active working context file at `/rules/context/tdd/active-working-context.mdc` must be maintained throughout the workflow process. This file tracks:

- Current phase and step
- Current feature being implemented
- Status of test creation and implementation
- Any blockers or issues encountered

## Feature Registry

The feature registry at `/rules/gameplay/intended-features/` contains all features to be implemented, organized by category. Each feature has:

- Feature name and description
- Requirements and dependencies
- Status ([planned], [ready], [in-progress], [done])
- Priority level

When selecting a feature, the AI should prioritize features that are [ready] and have no unmet dependencies.

